# Standard objects whose default ListViews ship from the platform with
# names/picklist values that violate Salesforce's own deploy validation,
# making round-trip (pull -> deploy) impossible. Ignore on retrieve and deploy.
**/CommSubscriptionChannelType/listViews/**
**/PaymentGroup/listViews/**
**/jsconfig.json
**/.eslintrc.json
# OutboundEngagementTemplate ships a standard field (TemplateName) that the
# platform refuses to redeploy ("Could not resolve standard field's name"),
# breaking the nightly pull -> deploy round trip. The fixture doesn't use it.
**/OutboundEngagementTemplate/**
